-- The diff algorithms, and what the crate puts around them: `src/algorithms/`
-- and `src/common.rs`.
--
-- The crate's algorithms report to a hook as they go, and hooks are stacked:
-- `capture_diff` is Myers, patience or LCS into `Compact`, into `Replace`,
-- into `Capture`. Here an algorithm returns the operations it would have
-- reported, in order, and each hook is a function over that list -- which is
-- the same, since every hook in the stack only acts on what reaches it, in
-- order, and at the end.
--
-- Elements are compared through `same oldIndex newIndex`, so that one
-- implementation serves any kind of sequence.
--
